      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Notable companies in the neighborhood include Qualcomm, Pfizer Pharmaceuticals, Verizon, Google Inc., Texas Instruments, and Dexcom.",
